    "id": "id-296ac0a3eb9440668",
    "title": "Sweet Heat Frosties Chicken Sandwich",
    "description": "Ultra-crispy Frosties-crusted chicken marinated in a sweet and savory buttermilk marinade, air fried until golden, then brushed with a sticky sweet and spicy honey-sriracha glaze and served on toasted brioche buns.",
    "heroImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606755962773-d324e0a13086?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
    "category": "Chicken Sandwich",
